        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "## Two visuals, on the canvas and on paper\n\nRun the flow (**F5**), then open the **Report** tab.\n\n**1. An HTML visual.** *Sales Dashboard* is a **Show Web View** with its own\nhand-written HTML \u2014 CSS grid, gradients, rounded cards. A report places it\nas a picture of the card, taken by the same browser the card draws in, so\nthe design survives onto the page and into the PDF.\n\nThe card's **Width / Height** are what the HTML lays out against: drag the\ncard's edge, run again, and the report follows. `width=` on the embed only\ndecides how wide the finished picture sits.\n\n**2. A formatted table.** *Sales Table* carries conditional formatting \u2014 a\ngreen scale on revenue, data bars on orders, red rows where status is\n`fail`, currency and percent formats. All of it reaches the page,\nre-grounded for white paper, and the table stays real text: selectable in\nthe PDF, and free to break across a page.\n\nA table takes `width=` and `rows=` (how many rows before \"showing 3 of 5\").\n`ratio` / `height` / `scale` are for charts.\n",
          "width": 420,
          "height": 420
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null,
        "description": "",
