    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "report",
        "title": "Report",
        "kind": "report",
        "body": "# Regional review\n\nThe dashboard below is the **Sales Dashboard** card, exactly as it is drawn\non the canvas \u2014 layout, gradients and all:\n\n![[Sales Dashboard]]\n\nPlaced narrower, it is the same design, not a squeezed one:\n\n![[Sales Dashboard|width=55%]]\n\n\\pagebreak\n\n## The numbers\n\nThe table arrives with the formatting the card is showing:\n\n![[Sales Table]]\n\nTwo thirds of the column, and only the first three rows:\n\n![[Sales Table|width=66%|rows=3]]\n\nBoth stay real text on the page \u2014 select a figure in the exported PDF and\nit is still a figure.\n",
        "color": null,
